{"task_id": "Mbpp/6", "solution": "```python\ndef differ_At_One_Bit_Pos(num1: int, num2: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if two integers differ at exactly one bit position.\n    Returns True if they differ at one bit, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    xor_result = num1 ^ num2\n    # A number x is a positive power of 2 if x > 0 and (x & (x - 1)) == 0.\n    return xor_result > 0 and (xor_result & (xor_result - 1)) == 0\n```"}
