{"task_id": "Mbpp/16", "solution": "```python\nimport re\n\n\ndef text_lowercase_underscore(input_string: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the input string consists of lowercase letter sequences joined by single underscores.\n    It returns True for valid strings, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    # This regex matches one or more lowercase letters, optionally followed by an underscore\n    # and more lowercase letters, from the start to the end of the string.\n    pattern = r\"^[a-z]+(?:_[a-z]+)*$\"\n    return bool(re.fullmatch(pattern, input_string))\n```"}
